ear degree in Unani</strong> along with <strong>10 years of teaching experience</strong>. The age limit is <strong>30 to 50 years</strong>.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 28.1072%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">LECTURER ILMUL SAIDLA,S-11/04</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.992%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.9008%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>5-year degree in Unani</strong> and a <strong>Master\u2019s degree in a related subject</strong>. They should also have <strong>adequate knowledge of Hindi/English and Urdu, Arabic, or Persian</strong>. The age limit is <strong>25 to 40 years</strong>.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 28.1072%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">LECTURER ILMUL ADVIA,S-11/05</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.992%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.9008%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>5-year degree in Unani</strong> and a <strong>Master\u2019s degree in a related subject</strong>. Additionally, they should have <strong>adequate knowledge of Hindi/English and Urdu, Arabic, or Persian</strong>. The age limit is <strong>25 to 40 years</strong>.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 28.1072%; height: 50px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">READER HOMOEOPATHIC MATERIA MEDICA,S-11/01</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.992%; height: 50px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">08</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.9008%; height: 50px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have a <strong>Master\u2019s degree in Homeopathy</strong> with <strong>4 years of teaching experience</strong>. The age limit is <strong>28 to 45 years</strong>.</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 28.1072%; height: 50px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">READER HOMOEOPATHIC PHARMACY,S-11/02</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 15.992%; height: 50px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">03</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 55.9008%; height: 50px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Master\u2019s degree in Homeopathy with <strong>4 years of teaching experience</strong>. Age limit: <strong>28 to 45 years</strong>.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 337px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><strong> UPPSC Various Post Examination 2025 : Exam Pattern\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 38.3694%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><strong>Exam Details</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.6306%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><strong>Information</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 38.3694%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">Exam Mode</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.6306%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">Offline (Pen and Paper-Based)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 38.3694%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><strong>Preliminary Exam</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.6306%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">(Multiple Choice Questions) Objective Type</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 38.3694%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">Total Marks</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.6306%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">500 Marks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 38.3694%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">Exam Duration</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.6306%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\">2 Hours</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 85px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 38.3694%; text-align: center; height: 85px;\">Marking Scheme</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.6306%; text-align: center; height: 85px;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Correct Answer: +1 mark</li>\n<li>Negative Marking : -1/3 mark</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong></span> <strong><a class=\"wp-block-latest-posts__post-title\" href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/niacl-assistants-online-form-2024/\">NIACL Assistants Online Form 2024</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>\u00a0How To Fill UPPSC Various Post Online Form 2025\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Interested candidates who wish to apply for the <b>UPPSC </b>post can submit their application online before <strong>24 April 2025.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Use the click here link provided below under important link section to apply directly.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Alternatively, visit the <strong>official website of UPPSC </strong>to complete the application process online.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Make sure to complete the application before the deadline <a href=\"https://uppsc.up.nic.in/\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>24 April 2025.</strong></span></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 438px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UPPSC Various Post Online Form 2025 While Form Filling Document Required\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Documents\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; text-align: center; height: 25px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Details</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 84px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 84px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Photo</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 84px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A passport-sized colored photo.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Background should be white or light-colored.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 84px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 84px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Signature</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 84px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Clear signature on white paper using a black or blue pen.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 84px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 84px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Educational Certificates</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 84px;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A bachelor\u2019s degree from a recognized university.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Read the Notification For More Details\u00a0</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 59px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 59px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Caste Certificate</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 59px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For reserved category candidates.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Aadhaar Card For Id Proof</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Aadhaar card, Voter ID, or any other government-issued ID.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Domicile Certificate</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Proof of residence for candidates from Rajasthan state.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 25px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; height: 25px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Income Certificate</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%; height: 25px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For candidates applying under the Economically Weaker Section (EWS) category.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 35.1767%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Other Certificates</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 64.8233%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Certificates for special categories (such as PH, Ex-servicemen) if applicable.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">UPPSC Various Post Recruitment 2025 : </span>Mode Of Selection\u00a0</span></strong