 Recruitment 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The <strong>Minimum age required is 21 Years &amp; The Maximum Age Is 40 Years as on 01 July 2025.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 143px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 143px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the eligibility for <strong>UPPSC Various Post Recruitment 2025</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: </strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A bachelor\u2019s degree from a recognized university.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Read the Notification For More Details\u00a0</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 117px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 100%; height: 117px;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of the <strong>UPPSC</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of the <b>UPPSC </b>is https://uppsc.up.nic.in/</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"UPPSC Various Post Recruitment 2025\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-17242 size-full\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"675\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/uppsc-recruitment-2025-apply-online-for-11-professor-research-officer-and-other-posts-67e3b9877fcde89421637-1200.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/uppsc-recruitment-2025-apply-online-for-11-professor-research-officer-and-other-posts-67e3b9877fcde89421637-1200.jpg 1200w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/uppsc-recruitment-2025-apply-online-for-11-professor-research-officer-and-other-posts-67e3b9877fcde89421637-1200-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/03